      "hizbQuarter": 145,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2889,
      "text": "Those who will be dragged on their faces to Hell – they will be in the worst position and farthest astray from the right path.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 25,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الفُرۡقَانِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Furqaan",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Criterion",
        "numberOfAyahs": 77,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 34,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 363,
      "ruku": 312,
      "hizbQuarter": 145,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2890,
      "text": "We gave Moses the Scripture and appointed along with him his brother Aaron as a helper.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 25,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الفُرۡقَانِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Furqaan",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Criterion",
        "numberOfAyahs": 77,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 35,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 363,
      "ruku": 313,
      "hizbQuarter": 145,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2891,
      "text": "We said, “Go, both of you, to the people who have rejected Our signs[17].” Then We destroyed them utterly.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 25,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الفُرۡقَانِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Furqaan",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Criterion",
        "numberOfAyahs": 77,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 36,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 363,
      "ruku": 313,
      "hizbQuarter": 145,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2892,
      "text": "Also the people of Noah, when they rejected the messengers[18], We drowned them and made them an example for mankind. And We have prepared for the wrongdoers a painful punishment.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 25,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الفُرۡقَانِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Furqaan",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Criterion",
        "numberOfAyahs": 77,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 37,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 363,
      "ruku": 313,
      "hizbQuarter": 145,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2893,
      "text": "Also [We destroyed] ‘Ād and Thamūd, and the people of the Well[19], and many generations between them.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 25,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الفُرۡقَانِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Furqaan",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Criterion",
        "numberOfAyahs": 77,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 38,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 363,
      "ruku": 313,
      "hizbQuarter": 145,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2894,
      "text": "To each We gave examples [of the previous nations], and each We destroyed completely.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 25,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الفُرۡقَانِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Furqaan",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Criterion",
        "numberOfAyahs": 77,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 39,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 363,
      "ruku": 313,
      "hizbQuarter": 145,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2895,
      "text": "They have surely passed by the town[20] that was destroyed by a terrible rain [of stones]. Have they not seen it? But they do not expect to be resurrected[21].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 25,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الفُرۡقَانِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Furqaan",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Criterion",
        "numberOfAyahs": 77,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 40,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 363,
      "ruku": 313,
      "hizbQuarter": 145,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2896,
      "text": "When they see you [O Prophet], they only ridicule you, “Is this the one whom Allah has sent as a messenger?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 25,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الفُرۡقَانِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Furqaan",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Criterion",
        "numberOfAyahs": 77,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 41,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 363,
      "ruku": 313,
      "hizbQuarter": 145,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2897,
      "text": "He would have almost led us astray from our gods if we had not been so devoted to them.” But when they see the punishment, they will come to know who is further astray from the right way.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 25,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الفُرۡقَانِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Furqaan",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Criterion",
        "numberOfAyahs": 77,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 42,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 363,
      "ruku": 313,
      "hizbQuarter": 145,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2898,
      "text": "Have you [O Prophet] seen the one who takes his desire as his god, will you then be a keeper over him?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 25,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الفُرۡقَانِ",
